        1   DEFINE TEMP-TABLE tt-trn-doc NO-UNDO LIKE ub.trn-doc.
        2   DEFINE NEW SHARED BUFFER X_chk-doc FOR ub.chk-doc.
        3   define input parameter parparentproc AS WIDGET-HANDLE no-undo.
