     2360           b-sch :tooltip = "Установлен фильтр " + p-filter-name
     2361         .
     2362       end.
     2363       else do:
     2364         assign
     2365           b-sch :tooltip = ""
     2366         .
     2367       end.
     2368     end.
     2369   end procedure.
     2370   ON WINDOW-CLOSE OF FRAME d-chk APPLY "END-ERROR":U TO SELF.
