     2405   empty temp-table thbjattr_thbj-attr.
     2406   run adm/shattri.p (
     2407      input "get":U
     2408     ,input ''
     2409     ,input 0
     2410     ,input 'nakl_par':U
     2411     ,input  ""
     2412     ,output v-value-character
     2413     ,output v-value-date
     2414     ,output v-value-decimal
     2415     ,output v-value-integer
     2416     ,output v-value-logical
     2417     ,output par-type
     2418     ,INPUT-OUTPUT TABLE thbjattr_thbj-attr
     2419     ) no-error .
     2420     for each thbjattr_thbj-attr :
