     2483           and thbjattr_thbj-attr.obj-code = p-obj-code
     2484           and thbjattr_thbj-attr.upper-prop-code = 'get-chk':U
     2485           and thbjattr_thbj-attr.prop-code = 'cas-curs':U no-error.
     2486     if available thbjattr_thbj-attr then do:
