     2564   MAIN-BLOCK:
     2565   DO ON ERROR   UNDO MAIN-BLOCK, LEAVE MAIN-BLOCK
     2566         ON END-KEY UNDO MAIN-BLOCK, LEAVE MAIN-BLOCK:
     2567     for each tt-trn-doc:
